10332236,2024-10-03,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"Re : Request for Removal of Closed and Charged-Off Accounts Accounts : DEPT OF EDUCATION/XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX To Whom It May Concern, I am writing to formally request the removal of the above-referenced closed and charged-off accounts from my credit report. These accounts are inaccurately and illegally reporting, and their continued presence on my credit file violates federal and state laws.

